Package: lanscan
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: SubSite - Fredrik Welander <subsite@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/subsite/lanscan
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo,
 gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.6), gir1.2-graphene-1.0, nmap,
 iproute2, iputils-ping, pkexec
Recommends: avahi-utils, network-manager, iw
Description: Graphical overview of the devices on your networks
 LAN Scan shows every device on the networks this computer is connected
 to, in a list grouped by network and on a map. Devices are found with
 nmap, ping, mDNS and UPnP, and identified by vendor, model, type and
 operating system.
